            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Gujarati for capable, then the Gujarati for special."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ફેર",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ફેર — pher — \"a difference\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે બંને ગીતો સાંભળશો તો તમે ફેર ઓળખી શકશો. jo tame banne gīto sā̃bhaḷśo to tame pher oḷkhī śakśo. If you listen to both songs, you'll be able to tell the difference."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ફેર (pher) is filed by CDIAL under phirati, \"turns\", with a Gujarati pher, \"a turn\" (CDIAL 9078); how the word came to mean a difference is not explained there."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
